== cancelling parked operations
root cancels
send task: send -> Cancelled
receive task: receive -> cancelled
first select: arm a cancelled
second select: arm b cancelled
the scope exited after every task finished
== a select with only a join arm
slow task: cancelled on entry is false
root cancels
slow task: done
join-only select: committed 7, cancelled is true
== an operation by a task cancelled before it ran
started cancelled: true
receive from a buffer -> value 41
send with room -> Sent
receive from an empty channel -> cancelled
send to a full channel -> Cancelled
select with a ready arm -> value 42
select with nothing ready -> cancelled
try_receive -> empty
probe: started, cancelled is true
room now holds value 1
== nested shutdown
root cancels
level 3: receive -> cancelled
level 2: receive -> cancelled
level 1: receive -> cancelled
level 1: scope drained
level 2: scope drained
level 3: scope drained
all scopes drained
